# Cloudflare Pages serves static files first, so every prerendered route keeps its
# own HTML. Only the paths that genuinely need client-side resolution fall back to
# the SPA shell — catalog slugs outside the prerendered set, and the client-only
# /admin area. Everything else still reaches 404.html with a real 404 status, so
# typos and dead links are not turned into indexable soft-404s.
/movies/*  /index.html  200
/watch/*   /index.html  200
/actors/* /index.html  200
/party/*  /index.html  200
/genres/*  /index.html  200
/admin     /index.html  200
/admin/*   /index.html  200
